  "architecture_summary": "FrostFlow is an Angular 19 single-page application serving as an inventory and sales management system. The app uses Supabase for backend services including PostgreSQL database access and JWT authentication. It features role-based access control with an auth guard protecting all routes except login. The application includes multiple feature modules for sales tracking, inventory management, staff administration, financial reconciliation, and AI-powered analytics. Data flows through a central Supabase service that handles all database operations and authentication. The UI uses a layout-based architecture with admin and main layouts, sidebar navigation, and reusable components for loading states, toast notifications, and stock alerts. Chart.js is integrated for dashboard metrics visualization.",
